The '''Composter''' is a feature in {{zone|The Garden}} that allows the player to create [[Compost|{{Gold|Compost}}]]. The Composter takes 10 minutes to create each {{Gold|Compost}}, consuming {{Green|4000}} {{Yellow|Organic Matter}} and {{Green|2000}} [[Machine Fuel|{{DarkGreen|Machine Fuel}}]] per [[Compost]] continuously in the process. However, these values can be improved by upgrading the Composter.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Mechanics ==
=== Organic Matter ===
{{/Organic Matter Calculator}}<!--
Blank comment (thanks for the fix!)-->
When inserted into the Composter, certain items can be converted into '''Organic Matter'''. Items cannot be taken out of the Composter once they have been inserted. {{Green|4000}} {{Yellow|Organic Matter}} is needed to make each {{Gold|Compost}}, excluding upgrades. The best item to buy from the [[Bazaar]] for making [[Organic Matter]] is currently {{ID|{{#var:omcalc_best_item}}}} at {{c|{{#expr:ceil({{#var:omcalc_cost_per_compost}})}}}} per {{Green|4000}} {{Yellow|Organic Matter}}. On {{Gamemode|Ironman}} profiles, {{Item|Enchanted Seeds}} and {{Item|Box of Seeds}} are good because visitors don't ask for Seeds.

The following table gives the {{Yellow|Organic Matter}} value for all known compostable items. All {{Yellow|Organic Matter}} values below are exact. For example, {{Item|Potato}}es are worth exactly 0.33 organic matter, not 1/3. However, the amount per 4000 organic matter is rounded.

Note that a {{Item|Condensed Fermento}} can only be used with sufficient Composter upgrades because they are worth more than the base limit of {{Green|40,000}} {{Yellow|Organic Matter}}.

